#==============================================================================================
#
#   abstract_operations - WebIDL abstract operations: conversions, callbacks, buffer copies
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/WebIDL/AbstractOperations.cpp (lines 1-580) and
#       AbstractOperations.h (lines 1-91). IntegerPart and ConvertToInt are ported in full
#       (ConvertToInt's ToNumber handles the primitive values; strings and objects are JS cells,
#       phase 3). Calling a user object's operation, invoking callback functions, constructing
#       through a callback, the string conversions of JS values, buffer source copies and
#       set_prototype_from_new_target operate on JS objects and come with luce-js (phase 3).
